{"meta":{"id":"basic-tools","category":"it/server/infra/home-server","title":"3. 기본 도구","subtitle":"","summary":"vim · htop · ncdu · lm-sensors · tmux · dnsutils · mtr · jq · fail2ban 설치와 vim · tmux · 모니터링 최소 사용법","tags":["ubuntu","리눅스","서버","홈서버","vim","tmux"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"ubunto_start","updatedAt":"2026-10-31"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>TOOLS</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-31</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">3. 기본 도구</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> vim · htop · ncdu · lm-sensors · tmux · dnsutils · mtr · jq · fail2ban 설치와 vim · tmux · 모니터링 최소 사용법</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">한 번에 설치</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo apt update\r\nsudo apt install -y vim htop ncdu lm-sensors tmux curl wget net-tools dnsutils mtr-tiny git tree unzip zip jq fail2ban</pre></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">분류</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">패키지</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">편집</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>vim</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">설정 파일 편집</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">모니터링</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>htop</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ncdu</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>lm-sensors</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">프로세스 · 디스크 사용량 · CPU 온도 (덮개 닫고 쓰는 노트북이라 온도 확인 필요)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">터미널</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>tmux</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSH 가 끊겨도 작업 유지, 화면 분할</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">네트워크</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>curl</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>wget</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>net-tools</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>dnsutils</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>mtr-tiny</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">웹 요청, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>dig</code>, 경로 · 손실 추적</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">관리</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>tree</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>zip/unzip</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>jq</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">버전 관리, 폴더 트리, 압축, JSON 보기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">보안</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>fail2ban</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">로그인 실패를 반복하는 IP 자동 차단 (설정은 OpenSSH 문서)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">기본으로 들어 있는 것: <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ufw</code>(방화벽, 기본 inactive), <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>unattended-upgrades</code>(보안 업데이트 자동 설치, active).</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">vim 최소 사용법</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">키</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">동작</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>i</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Esc</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">입력 모드 시작 / 끝</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:wq</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:q!</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">저장 후 종료 / 저장 안 하고 종료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>dd</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>u</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">한 줄 삭제 / 되돌리기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/단어</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">검색, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>n</code> 다음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:set paste</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">붙여넣기 때 들여쓰기가 계단처럼 밀리는 것 방지</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">기본 편집기를 vim 으로: <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>sudo update-alternatives --set editor /usr/bin/vim.basic</code></p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">tmux</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">오래 걸리는 업데이트나 다운로드는 tmux 안에서 돌려 SSH 가 끊겨도 계속 실행되게 합니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">tmux new -s work       # &quot;work&quot; 세션 시작\r\ntmux ls                # 세션 목록\r\ntmux a -t work         # SSH 가 끊긴 뒤 다시 붙기</pre></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">키</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">동작</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Ctrl+b d</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">세션에서 빠져나오기 (작업은 계속)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Ctrl+b %</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Ctrl+b \"</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">좌우 / 상하 분할</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Ctrl+b c</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Ctrl+b n</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">새 창 / 다음 창</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">모니터링 · 네트워크 확인</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">htop                    # q 종료, F6 정렬, F9 프로세스 종료\r\nncdu /                  # 디스크 많이 쓰는 폴더\r\ndf -h; free -h          # 디스크 · 메모리\r\nsudo sensors-detect --auto &amp;&amp; sensors   # CPU 온도 (평소 40~60°C, 80°C 이상 지속이면 통풍 확인)\r\nss -tulnp               # 열린 포트 (22 SSH, 5xxxx WireGuard)\r\ndig google.com          # DNS 응답\r\nmtr -rw -c 10 8.8.8.8   # 경로 + 구간별 손실률\r\ncurl -4 ifconfig.me     # 공인 IP</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/home-server/basic-tools","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"home-server","title":"홈 서버 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/server/infra/home-server"}],"hasImage":false}